@startuml Signing_Phase2_Verification
title Aşama 2: Kriptografik İşlem Doğrulama (Gerçek Transfer Akışı)

skinparam maxMessageSize 150
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #2C3E50
    LifeLineBorderColor #34495E
    LifeLineBackgroundColor #ECF0F1
    ParticipantBorderColor #27AE60
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #2ECC71
    ParticipantFontColor #FFFFFF
    ParticipantFontSize 14
    ParticipantFontName Arial
}

actor "Kullanıcı" as User
participant "Frontend/Mobil\n(WebCrypto API)" as Client
participant "API Gateway\n(:8080)" as Gateway
participant "Banking Service\n(AuthSvc :8081)" as AuthSvc
participant "Signing Service\n(:8083)" as SignSvc
participant "ML Fraud Engine\n(:5001)" as MLEngine
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

User -> Client: Para Transferi Başlat\n("Para Gönder" Butonu)
activate Client

Client -> Client: Düz Metin Oluştur\n("IBAN:TR...,AMOUNT:1000,DESC:Kira")
Client -> Client: Metni SHA-256 ile Hashle
Client -> Client: Hash'i Private Key ile İmzala\n(Signature)

Client -> Gateway: POST /api/v1/banking/transfers\n(iban, amount, signature)
activate Gateway
Gateway -> AuthSvc: İsteği İlet (BankingController)
activate AuthSvc

AuthSvc -> SignSvc: POST http://localhost:8083/api/v1/signing/verify\n(userId, payload, signature)
activate SignSvc

SignSvc -> DB: findByUserId()
activate DB
DB --> SignSvc: Kullanıcının Kayıtlı Public Key'i
deactivate DB

SignSvc -> SignSvc: SHA256withECDSA Doğrulaması Başlat\n(Public Key ile İmza Eşleşiyor mu?)

alt İmza Geçerli (Signature is Valid)
    SignSvc --> AuthSvc: 200 OK (İmza Başarılı)
    AuthSvc -> MLEngine: evaluate(transaction)\n(İmza sağlamsa Yapay Zeka devreye girer)
    activate MLEngine
    MLEngine --> AuthSvc: Fraud Değerlendirme Sonucu
    deactivate MLEngine
    AuthSvc --> Gateway: 200 OK (İşlem Tamamlandı / Onay Bekliyor)
    Gateway --> Client: Transfer Durumu Gösterilir
else İmza Geçersiz / Manipülasyon Var
    SignSvc --> AuthSvc: 400 Bad Request (Cryptographic Error)
    AuthSvc --> Gateway: 400 Bad Request ("Geçersiz kriptografik imza!")
    Gateway --> Client: Güvenlik İhlali! İşlem Anında Engellendi.
end

deactivate SignSvc
deactivate AuthSvc
deactivate Gateway
Client --> User: Sonucu Göster
deactivate Client
@enduml
